Package: ctMRS
Type: Package
Title: Single-Cell Multi-Omics Mutation Regulatory Scoring
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kangnan", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "105203580+CKNckn11@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Builds full-genome transcription-factor--peak--gene regulatory
    networks from paired single-cell RNA and ATAC data, integrates recurrent
    somatic mutations at accessible peaks, and calculates cell-type
    specificity (CTS), mutation gene-regulatory scores (MGRS), and combined
    mutation regulatory scores (MRS) with matched-control Monte Carlo tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
