    GenomicRanges,
    IRanges,
    Matrix,
    S4Vectors,
    Seurat,
    SeuratObject,
    Signac,
    stringr,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/CKNckn11/ctMRS
